<title>SINGAPORE: Bangchak tenders to buy 1,500/T MTBE for June.</title>
<headline>Bangchak tenders to buy 1,500/T MTBE for June.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Bangchak Petroleum Plc has issued a tender to buy 1,500 tonnes of methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE) for delivery in June, a company source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender for the gasoline octane booster closes on May 14 and offers are valid to May 15.</p>
<p>In its last tender, Bangchak bought a cargo for May delivery at $270 per tonne on a cost-and-freight basis to Thailand from Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC).</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3093)</p>
